---
description: Use Flatpack components for Recording Studio UI
globs: "**/*.{erb,html,css,js}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Use Flatpack ViewComponents for new UI whenever an appropriate component exists.

Do not recreate buttons, forms, alerts, cards, modals, or navigation with custom markup or CSS.

Prefer the Recording Studio core default layout and one primary action per page (`recording-studio-ui`). Keep titles and buttons fun, short, and clear (`recording-studio-text`).

Check https://flatpack.bowerbird.io/ and existing repo usage before adding UI.

Semantic layout markup is acceptable when Flatpack does not provide the structure.

If Flatpack cannot support a requirement, explain the gap before introducing custom UI.
